# TypeScript build output. Publish-only artifact: package `main`/`types`/`bin`
# and the `files` allowlist all point at dist/, so `npm publish` ships whatever
# is on disk — but dist/ is NEVER committed. Every publish MUST rebuild it fresh
# from HEAD (a stale dist/ silently ships a broken package — this bit us, sweep
# finding #5). See the clean-build + tarball-smoke gate in OPEN_ITEMS.md
# ("Release sequence" step 3 / "Wave J publish gates"). Also matched by the
# repo-root .gitignore `dist/` rule; pinned here too so the package stays
# self-documenting if this dir is ever split out on its own.
dist/

# Foreground-helper binaries are built by CI (build-foreground-helpers.yml)
# and bundled into the npm tarball at publish time. Never commit them.
bin/helpers/

# Native helper build outputs
# Windows (.NET)
native/win32/foreground-helper/bin/
native/win32/foreground-helper/obj/
native/win32/foreground-helper/publish/
# macOS (Swift)
native/darwin/foreground-helper/.build/
native/darwin/foreground-helper/ProvianForegroundHelper.app/

# npm pack output
*.tgz
